# Task Manager (SwiftUI) 📝

## Description
A simple SwiftUI app that allows users to manage daily tasks.  
This project focuses on UI/UX design and basic state management in iOS development.

## Features
- Add new tasks
- Display task list
- Delete tasks

## Focus
This project was built to practice:
- Basic SwiftUI layout
- User interaction
- Simple UI/UX flow

